WEBVTT

00:00:05.787 --> 00:00:08.147
Prisoners disabled,
Commander Lotso!

00:00:08.267 --> 00:00:10.467
-Buzz, what are you doing?
-Silence, minions of Zurg!

00:00:10.547 --> 00:00:12.627
You're in the custody
of the Galactic Alliance!

00:00:12.707 --> 00:00:14.147
-"Zurg"?
-"Galactic Alliance"?

00:00:14.267 --> 00:00:15.307
Oh, boy.

00:00:15.387 --> 00:00:18.067
Good work, Lightyear.
Now, lock 'em up!

00:00:18.147 --> 00:00:19.227
Yes, sir!

00:00:20.467 --> 00:00:21.787
(SHRIEKS)

00:00:25.787 --> 00:00:27.467
-(EXCLAIMING)
-Ow!

00:00:29.147 --> 00:00:31.427
Where do you think you're going?

00:00:32.787 --> 00:00:34.507
Buzz! We're your friends!

00:00:34.587 --> 00:00:36.507
Spare me your lies, temptress.

00:00:36.627 --> 00:00:38.067
Your emperor's defeated,

00:00:38.147 --> 00:00:41.267
and I'm immune to
your bewitching good looks.

00:00:41.347 --> 00:00:43.987
Hey, Mongo!
Keep your paws off my wife!

00:00:44.067 --> 00:00:45.747
Hey! Let go of me, you drooling doofus!

00:00:45.827 --> 00:00:46.907
LOTSO: Not him.

00:00:46.987 --> 00:00:50.507
I think this potato needs to
learn himself some manners.

00:00:50.587 --> 00:00:52.347
Take him to the box.

00:00:52.427 --> 00:00:55.107
Hey! Put me down, you moron!
Where are you taking me?

00:00:55.187 --> 00:00:56.587
Bad baby! Bad baby!

00:00:56.667 --> 00:00:58.307
Ken? What's going on?

00:00:58.627 --> 00:01:01.667
Barbie! I told you to wait
in the Dream House.

00:01:01.787 --> 00:01:03.027
What are you doing to my friends?

00:01:03.347 --> 00:01:04.867
TWITCH: Get in there!

00:01:06.347 --> 00:01:08.267
-Barbie, wait!
-Don't touch me.

00:01:08.347 --> 00:01:10.867
-We're through!
-Barbie! I did...

00:01:12.547 --> 00:01:15.187
-And give me my scarf back!
-Ow!

00:01:16.547 --> 00:01:19.387
Lightyear! Explain our
overnight accommodations.

00:01:19.827 --> 00:01:22.707
Sir, yes, sir!
Prisoners sleep in their cells.

00:01:22.787 --> 00:01:26.507
Any prisoner caught outside their cell
spends the night in the box.

00:01:26.947 --> 00:01:28.707
Roll call at dusk and dawn.

00:01:29.187 --> 00:01:32.947
Any prisoner misses roll call,
spends the night in the box.

00:01:33.307 --> 00:01:36.067
Prisoners do not speak
unless spoken to.

00:01:36.147 --> 00:01:38.387
Any prisoner talks back,
spends the night...

00:01:38.507 --> 00:01:39.987
In the box! We get it.

00:01:41.347 --> 00:01:44.147
At ease, soldier. They're neutralized.

00:01:44.227 --> 00:01:47.747
But remember, they'll say anything
to make you doubt yourself.

00:01:47.827 --> 00:01:49.147
Don't worry, Commander.

00:01:49.227 --> 00:01:52.347
Any doubt I had
got pounded out of me at the academy.

00:01:53.067 --> 00:01:54.587
LOTSO: Listen up, folks.

00:01:54.707 --> 00:01:57.187
We got a way of doin' things
here at Sunnyside.

00:01:57.707 --> 00:02:00.307
If you start at the bottom,
pay your dues,

00:02:00.427 --> 00:02:02.707
life here can be a dream come true!

00:02:03.547 --> 00:02:06.587
But if you break our rules,
step outta line,

00:02:07.387 --> 00:02:13.027
try to check out early,
well, you're just hurtin' yourselves.

00:02:13.267 --> 00:02:14.347
(TOYS GASPING)

00:02:14.427 --> 00:02:16.587
Woody! What did you do to him?

00:02:17.187 --> 00:02:19.507
You all get a good night's rest.

00:02:20.107 --> 00:02:22.787
You got a full day of playtime
tomorrow.

00:02:22.867 --> 00:02:24.067
(LAUGHING)

00:02:28.907 --> 00:02:32.187
1225 Syca...

00:02:32.267 --> 00:02:33.347
(CHIMES)

00:02:33.427 --> 00:02:35.707
Who's Velocistar237?

00:02:35.787 --> 00:02:38.467
Oh! That's just a dinosaur toy
down the street.

00:02:38.547 --> 00:02:40.867
That's nothing.
Let me just take care of that.

00:02:40.947 --> 00:02:42.787
-Just a dinosaur.
-All right.

00:02:43.267 --> 00:02:46.027
Sycamore. Okay, enter!

00:02:46.827 --> 00:02:48.907
Please don't be far. Please, please!

00:02:50.427 --> 00:02:53.307
Right around the corner?
It's right around the corner!

00:02:53.427 --> 00:02:54.707
Yay!

00:02:54.787 --> 00:02:59.147
I'm going to college! Look at me!
I'm big toy on campus! Hello!

00:02:59.267 --> 00:03:01.947
-Hey, I'll see you at the sock hop.
-Okay, Potsie.

00:03:02.187 --> 00:03:05.587
Hey, listen. If any of you guys
ever get to Sunnyside Daycare,

00:03:05.667 --> 00:03:06.707
you tell 'em Woody made it home.

00:03:06.827 --> 00:03:10.067
-You came from Sunnyside?
-But how'd you escape?

00:03:10.147 --> 00:03:11.987
Well, it wasn't easy.

00:03:12.987 --> 00:03:14.187
What do you mean "escape"?

00:03:15.827 --> 00:03:18.907
Sunnyside is a place
of ruin and despair.

00:03:18.987 --> 00:03:22.547
Ruled by an evil bear
who smells of strawberries.

00:03:23.667 --> 00:03:24.867
Lotso?

00:03:24.987 --> 00:03:27.587
The guy may seem plush
and huggable on the outside,

00:03:27.667 --> 00:03:29.467
but inside, he's a monster.

00:03:29.667 --> 00:03:31.827
But... How do you know that?

00:03:32.547 --> 00:03:34.867
Chuckles. He'll tell you.

00:03:40.867 --> 00:03:42.627
CHUCKLES: Yeah, I knew Lotso.

00:03:44.067 --> 00:03:46.827
He was a good toy. A friend.

00:03:47.627 --> 00:03:51.307
Me and him,
we had the same kid, Daisy.

00:03:52.827 --> 00:03:55.707
I was there
when Lotso got unwrapped.

00:03:58.147 --> 00:03:59.867
Daisy loved us all.

00:04:00.387 --> 00:04:01.547
But Lotso,

00:04:02.027 --> 00:04:03.827
Lotso was special.

00:04:05.347 --> 00:04:07.507
They did everything together.

00:04:08.547 --> 00:04:11.667
You've never seen
a kid and a toy more in love.

00:04:12.507 --> 00:04:14.507
One day, we took a drive.

00:04:15.547 --> 00:04:18.707
Hit a rest stop. Had a little playtime.

00:04:19.747 --> 00:04:21.827
After lunch, Daisy fell asleep.

00:04:31.027 --> 00:04:32.747
She never came back.

00:04:38.027 --> 00:04:40.067
Lotso wouldn't give up.

00:04:43.707 --> 00:04:47.027
It took forever,
but we finally made it back to Daisy's.

00:04:53.787 --> 00:04:56.707
But by then, it was too late.

00:05:08.227 --> 00:05:10.987
Something changed that day
inside Lotso.

00:05:11.747 --> 00:05:13.267
Something snapped.

00:05:13.387 --> 00:05:15.587
She replaced us. Come on!

00:05:15.947 --> 00:05:18.907
-No, she only replaced you!
-She replaced all of us.

00:05:19.587 --> 00:05:20.587
Didn't she?

00:05:20.667 --> 00:05:21.947
(CRYING)

00:05:23.747 --> 00:05:25.467
She don't love you no more!

00:05:26.387 --> 00:05:27.947
Now come on!

00:05:32.667 --> 00:05:38.307
CHUCKLES: We were lost. Cast off.
Unloved. Unwanted.

00:05:43.267 --> 00:05:45.267
Then we found Sunnyside.

00:05:56.107 --> 00:05:58.427
But Lotso wasn't my friend anymore.

00:06:00.107 --> 00:06:02.147
He wasn't anyone's friend.

00:06:04.867 --> 00:06:07.947
He took over Sunnyside
and rigged the whole system.

00:06:08.627 --> 00:06:10.507
So how'd you get out?

00:06:10.827 --> 00:06:14.307
I got broke.
Bonnie found me, took me home.

00:06:14.947 --> 00:06:17.027
Other toys, they weren't so lucky.

00:06:17.867 --> 00:06:21.227
It ain't right what Lotso done.
New toys,

00:06:21.987 --> 00:06:23.987
they don't stand a chance.

00:06:24.267 --> 00:06:26.587
-But my friends are in there.
-You can't go back.

00:06:26.667 --> 00:06:29.027
Returning now would be suicide!

00:06:29.147 --> 00:06:30.947
But what about your Andy?

00:06:31.027 --> 00:06:33.947
Isn't he leaving for college?

00:06:36.947 --> 00:06:38.867
(HARMONICA PLAYING)

